    <Box style={{ width: 1120, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: '14px 22px', boxSizing: 'border-box', marginTop: 22 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>Selectivity AUROC <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>0.84</span> within known scaffolds — but <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>0.38 (below chance)</span> on new scaffolds, over 20 seeds. Used as a filter, the model would enrich the non-selective series.</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 14, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>Direct modelling of ΔpActivity and subtraction of two single-target models are indistinguishable. DPP4 is the dominant liability: 86% of dual-measured compounds are non-selective (mean Δ = −1.75 log).</Text>
